<section class="obodesk-section obodesk-why">
  <div class="obodesk-section__header">
    <p class="obodesk-eyebrow">Why OboDesk</p>
    <h2>Designed for the Modern Desk</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="obodesk-grid obodesk-grid--three">
    <article class="obodesk-point">
      <h3>Built for Focus</h3>
      <p>OboDesk essentials are selected to reduce visual noise and protect deep work.</p>
      <div class="obodesk-point__tags" aria-label="Built for Focus keywords">
        <span>Low friction</span>
        <span>Deep work</span>
        <span>Calm surface</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="obodesk-point">
      <h3>Designed for Clean Setups</h3>
      <p>A premium desk environment depends on structure, clear zones, and fewer loose objects.</p>
      <div class="obodesk-point__tags" aria-label="Designed for Clean Setups keywords">
        <span>Cable order</span>
        <span>Clear zones</span>
        <span>System layout</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="obodesk-point">
      <h3>Made for the Modern Desk</h3>
      <p>From focused AI work to creative sessions, the desk should feel intentional and ready.</p>
      <div class="obodesk-point__tags" aria-label="Made for the Modern Desk keywords">
        <span>AI workflow</span>
        <span>Visual atmosphere</span>
        <span>Premium essentials</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

